<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan overnight rates fluctuate widely.</title>
<headline>Pakistan overnight rates fluctuate widely.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan overnight rates fluctuated widely on Friday due to uncertainty about how liquid the market was, dealers said.</p>
<p>The market started with a wide gap in bids and offers at eight and 18 percent, a dealer of KASB &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates moved up and most deals were struck at 13 to 16 percent, the dealer said. However, rates slid before the close and borrowers managed to pick funds at 10 percent.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
